								<span>01</span>
								<div>
									<strong>Distance Formula</strong>
									<small>Formula d = √[(x₂-x₁)² + (y₂-y₁)²]</small>
								</div>
							</a>

							<a href="/coordinate-geometry/section-formula" class="sidebar-lesson active">
								<span>02</span>
								<div>
									<strong>Section Formula</strong>
